second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which person or organization did Colin R MacKenzie work for?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 100, \"text\": \"**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Colin R MacKenzie's Ties to University of Düsseldorf Revealed**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 102, \"end\": 327, \"text\": \"In a significant discovery, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence that Colin R MacKenzie, a prominent researcher in his field, was indeed affiliated with the prestigious University of Düsseldorf in Germany.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 328, \"end\": 569, \"text\": \"According to multiple sources, including academic publications and institutional records, MacKenzie held a research position at the University of Düsseldorf, where he contributed to various projects and collaborated with esteemed colleagues.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 570, \"end\": 573, \"text\": \"Dr.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 574, \"end\": 789, \"text\": \"Anna-Lena Schumann, a colleague of MacKenzie's at the University of Düsseldorf, corroborated our findings, stating, \\\"Colin was an integral part of our research team, and his expertise was invaluable to our projects.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 790, \"end\": 940, \"text\": \"His time at the university was marked by significant contributions to the field, and we're grateful for the opportunity to have worked alongside him.\\\"\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 941, \"end\": 1120, \"text\": \"A review of MacKenzie's publication record reveals a string of co-authored papers with University of Düsseldorf researchers, further solidifying his connection to the institution.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1121, \"end\": 1282, \"text\": \"One such paper, published in the esteemed journal _Nature Communications_, lists MacKenzie as a co-author alongside several University of Düsseldorf researchers.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1283, \"end\": 1467, \"text\": \"Data obtained from the university's human resources department confirms MacKenzie's employment, with records showing that he was a member of the university's faculty from 2015 to 2018.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1468, \"end\": 1536, \"text\": \"When asked about MacKenzie's tenure at the university, Professor Dr.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1537, \"end\": 1776, \"text\": \"Jürgen Schmid, Dean of the Faculty of Mathematics and Natural Sciences at the University of Düsseldorf, commented, \\\"Colin was a valued member of our academic community, and his research expertise was a significant asset to our institution.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1777, \"end\": 1826, \"text\": \"We're proud to have had him as part of our team.\\\"\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1827, \"end\": 1942, \"text\": \"In light of these findings, it is clear that Colin R MacKenzie did, in fact, work for the University of Düsseldorf.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1943, \"end\": 2101, \"text\": \"This revelation sheds new light on MacKenzie's impressive research background and underscores the significance of his contributions to the academic community.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2102, \"end\": 2114, \"text\": \"**Sources:**\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2116, \"end\": 2169, \"text\": \"* University of Düsseldorf Human Resources Department\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2170, \"end\": 2175, \"text\": \"* Dr.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2176, \"end\": 2234, \"text\": \"Anna-Lena Schumann, Researcher at University of Düsseldorf\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2235, \"end\": 2250, \"text\": \"* Professor Dr.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2251, \"end\": 2349, \"text\": \"Jürgen Schmid, Dean of the Faculty of Mathematics and Natural Sciences at University of Düsseldorf\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2350, \"end\": 2365, \"text\": \"* MacKenzie, C.\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2366, \"end\": 2376, \"text\": \"R., et al.\"}, \"D1S23\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2377, \"end\": 2384, \"text\": \"(2017).\"}, \"D1S24\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2385, \"end\": 2430, \"text\": \"\\\"Breakthrough in Materials Science Research.\\\"\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 29, \"text\": \"**Renowned Geologist Colin R.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 30, \"end\": 82, \"text\": \"MacKenzie Reflects on Illustrious Career with USGS**\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 84, \"end\": 99, \"text\": \"Washington D.C.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 100, \"end\": 151, \"text\": \"- In a career spanning over three decades, Colin R.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 152, \"end\": 354, \"text\": \"MacKenzie has left an indelible mark on the field of geology, and his work with the United States Geological Survey (USGS) has been instrumental in shaping our understanding of the Earth's complexities.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 355, \"end\": 517, \"text\": \"MacKenzie, a soft-spoken yet fiercely passionate researcher, joined the USGS in 1990, bringing with him a wealth of knowledge and expertise in structural geology.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 518, \"end\": 682, \"text\": \"Over the years, he has been an integral part of numerous high-profile projects, including the groundbreaking study on the tectonic evolution of the Rocky Mountains.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 683, \"end\": 839, \"text\": \"\\\"I was drawn to the USGS because of its commitment to advancing our understanding of the Earth's natural systems,\\\" MacKenzie said in an exclusive interview.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 840, \"end\": 939, \"text\": \"\\\"The opportunity to work alongside some of the brightest minds in the field was a dream come true.\\\"\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 940, \"end\": 1069, \"text\": \"One of MacKenzie's most notable contributions was his work on the USGS's flagship project, the National Geologic Mapping Program.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1070, \"end\": 1201, \"text\": \"As a lead researcher, he played a crucial role in developing new mapping techniques, which have since become the industry standard.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1202, \"end\": 1352, \"text\": \"\\\"Colin's expertise in structural geology was instrumental in helping us better understand the complex relationships between tectonic plates,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1353, \"end\": 1409, \"text\": \"Maria Rodriguez, a colleague and fellow USGS researcher.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1410, \"end\": 1488, \"text\": \"\\\"His work has had a lasting impact on our understanding of the Earth's crust.\\\"\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1489, \"end\": 1655, \"text\": \"According to data from the USGS, MacKenzie's research has been cited over 1,000 times in peer-reviewed journals, a testament to the significance of his contributions.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1656, \"end\": 1786, \"text\": \"His work has also been recognized with numerous awards, including the prestigious USGS Director's Award for Excellence in Science.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1787, \"end\": 1909, \"text\": \"As MacKenzie looks back on his illustrious career, he is quick to acknowledge the role the USGS has played in his success.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1910, \"end\": 2014, \"text\": \"\\\"The USGS provided me with the resources and support necessary to pursue my research passions,\\\" he said.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2015, \"end\": 2092, \"text\": \"\\\"I feel fortunate to have been a part of such a talented and dedicated team.\\\"\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2093, \"end\": 2227, \"text\": \"Today, MacKenzie continues to work as a researcher emeritus with the USGS, mentoring the next generation of geologists and scientists.\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2228, \"end\": 2429, \"text\": \"His legacy serves as a reminder of the importance of continued investment in scientific research and the critical role agencies like the USGS play in advancing our understanding of the world around us.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"University of Düsseldorf\", \"United States Geological Survey\", \"USGS\"], \"candidates\